Z||000000||fiero56||12-06-2001||12:09 AM||||First stop with a friend tonight was a gas station so they could get a pack of cigarettes. Walking in, we notice a guy at the counter holding a 6-pack of Heinekin and holding a piece of paper up to the cashier. Turns out the guy had a Snickers wrapper that said any drink free from Shell gas stations. He convinced the cashier a 6-pack was a drink and he walked out with the 6-pack for free. <P>Next stop was the mall. While cruising the halls, and this shouldn't be funny, but it was <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">, a lady in her mid-late 20s dropped a bag, and all we heard was the sound of glass breaking. I can't help but wonder what broke. We also saw a guy in his 20s almost being dragged by his arm by his girlfriend into the Victoria Secret. Was a funny sight to see. 20 minutes later as we walked by again, he was still in there(sitting in a chair near the door) waiting for her.<P>Also saw some highschool kid screwing around on the escelator at the mall with friends, he ended up falling down the thing, and played it off as though nothing happend.<P>Also ran to other places looking for a CD, still can't find it. Euphoria Level 3, mixed by Matt Darey. I can find Level 4 everywhere, not even Amazon has level 3.<P>Its amazing the things that go on in other peoples lives. Maybe my boring life is funny or interesting to others from the "outside". Never really thought about it before.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Standard||12-06-2001||12:23 AM||||the mall's always a good place to just go and look  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>But a guy wouldn't go into victoria's secret with his g/f?  What's wrong with him?  Or was she... uhhhh.. not the victoria's secret 'type'?  <P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierospeeder||12-06-2001||12:52 AM||||i think its illegal to give alcohol away for free, atleast in illinois it is.<P><BR>I had my g/f drag me in to victoria secret.  But i would wait next to the dressing room, while she changed and wanted me to check her out.   What pisses me off is, i cant get her to go to fredricks of hollywood store.<P><BR>I fell, on the esculator once.  But i was going the other way.  <P>I was in sears, looking for my g/f for 30 minutes, after getting done with the tool section.  I covered the store 3-4 times.  <BR>Im going down the esculator while she calls my name "fierospeeder"  so i try going back up the esculator.  I get to the last step and i fell.   Remember, im going back up on an esculator thats meant to go down.<P>She starts cracking up, and i beat her ass.  (just yelled at her) so she got mad.  So i made it up to her and bought her a tv for Xmas.  And its not my tv, its hers.  Evertime i ask her, if she still has my tv, no i dont i have mine.  UGH.<P>When she was living in illinois with her sister.  Her sister dated numerous guys.  Shes the type thats hot and dates around.  You know the usual scenerio for them type of girls.<P>Her sister wanted me to fix her boyfriends lincoln power steering hose.  My g/f watched me while i was fixing it.  After i was done, i told her to start the car while i inspect for any leaks.<P>Shes sitting in the car, while im looking for leaks and any other probs.  Shes playing around in the car and she accidently lays on the horn.  It freaking startled me, and shes cracking up that she did it on accident.  I yelled at her that its not funny that i could have cut my hand off in the fan blade or the alt fan.<P>Sorry, had to make a 2 page post.||||reg||1
